Add process-level integration coverage for OAuth access, refresh, browser sessions, discovery and named-view resource identifiers across restart. Exercise static-token compatibility where supported, token expiry/revocation, and transport session loss separately. Acceptance: deterministic local tests pass and a live verification procedure records deployment evidence or an explicit external-test limitation; no claim that MCP transport sessions persist.
